    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατα-λαμβάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>catch in</i> a place, <i>hem in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.116
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰ ὅρκοις</span>
			<i>trammel</i> by oaths, ib.<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν λογισμὸς ἐγκαταλαμβάνῃ αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.60
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				926b31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>follow in immediate succession</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παννυχὶς ἐ. ἑορτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					47(23).6
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				26(14).84
			</span></i>; <i>attack immediately after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπὶ τῷ ἐμέτῳ ἀσιτία [τινὰ] ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					47(23).60
				</span></i>
			.</div>
